				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13026885/aethris-artworks#post-4494914</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 09 Feb 2020 19:55:09 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Aethris</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5158506</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>There's been several references to Clef having three eyes, most notably in his <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/drclef-member-page">personnel file</a>:</p> <blockquote> <p>It has one green eye, one blue eye, and one hazel eye, both of which appear to have pupils which absorb all light falling upon it.</p> </blockquote> <p>But also in some articles, such as <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4231">The Montauk House</a>:</p> <blockquote> <p>&#8230;and her with her thousand eyes when he only had three&#8230;</p> </blockquote> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
